- N\u00b016) and replacement of fences\u201d. Online failure 66 kV Paine - EAF 351-2022 11-09-2022 The company CGE Transmission S.A. points out that it does not apply. Island of Maipo Falla online 66 kV The company CGE Transmission S.A. indicates that \"it does not apply\" EAF 358-2022 22-09-2022 Nahuelbuta - Angol corrective actions in the short term. The company CGE Transmission S.A. indicates: Failure in line 66 kV Linares \"Repair and normal configuration activities EAF 475-2022 18-12-2022 - Parral of the LT 66 kV Linares - Parral, whose works were completed on 20-12-2022 at 03:08 hours.\" The company CGE Transmission S.A.","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 303/2024\n\u201cFalla en la l\u00ednea 66 kV Curanilahue - Tres Pinos\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 02-08-2024\n1. Descripci\u00f3n pormenorizada de la perturbaci\u00f3n\n1. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 11/07/2024\nHora 21:17\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 19.75\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 11481.4\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.172 %\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\n2. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n L\u00ednea 66 kV Curanilahue - Tres Pinos / LT218CI1TR01----T0058\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n L\u00ednea\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 66 kV\nSegmento Transmisi\u00f3n zonal\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n afectada CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Quezada Escobar\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco N\u00b05561 piso 14, Las Condes.\n3. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nNombre del elemento afectado Estructura N\u00b0400 de la l\u00ednea 66 kV Curanilahue - Tres Pinos /\nLT218CI1TR01----T0058\nPropietario elemento fallado CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Quezada Escobar\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco N\u00b05561 piso 14, Las Condes.\nd.1 Origen y causa de la falla\nSe produjo la apertura autom\u00e1tica del interruptor 52BT3 de S/E Curanilahue, asociado al transformador\nregulador N\u00b01 66/66 kV, por operaci\u00f3n de los sistemas de protecci\u00f3n del pa\u00f1o B1 de la misma S/E,\nante una falla en la l\u00ednea 66 kV Curanilahue - Tres Pinos, atribuida al colapso de su estructura N\u00b0400.\nLa causa de la falla es atribuida al derribamiento intencional, por parte de terceros, de la estructura\nN\u00b0400 de la l\u00ednea 66 kV Curanilahue - Tres Pinos y el posterior robo de conductor entre las estructuras\nN\u00b0399 y N\u00b0400 de la mencionada l\u00ednea.\nd.2 Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico:\nVAN3: Robo o hurto.\nd.3 Reiteraci\u00f3n:\nReiteraci\u00f3n Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico en la instalaci\u00f3n afectada: Esta instalaci","shown_language":"en","word_scores":[{"w":"fault","s":0.21},{"w":"analysis","s":0.01},{"w":"eaf","s":0.13},{"w":"2024","s":-0.05},{"w":"fault","s":0.21},{"w":"line","s":1.0},{"w":"66","s":0.02},{"w":"kv","s":0.3},{"w":"date","s":-0.12},{"w":"description","s":0.02},{"w":"date","s":-0.12},{"w":"time","s":-0.09},{"w":"failure","s":0.09},{"w":"date","s":-0.12},{"w":"11","s":0.18},{"w":"07","s":-0.13},{"w":"2024","s":-0.05},{"w":"time","s":-0.09},{"w":"21","s":0.05},{"w":"17","s":0.04},{"w":"consumptions","s":-0.1},{"w":"mw","s":0.12},{"w":"19","s":-0.13},{"w":"mw","s":0.12},{"w":"percentage","s":-0.06},{"w":"disconnection","s":-0.02},{"w":"does","s":-0.05},{"w":"apply","s":0.08},{"w":"percentage","s":-0.06}]},"predictions":{"conflux":{"pred":"line_fault","display_pred":"SHORT CIRCUIT","probs":{"line_fault":0.9847,"breaker_fault":0.0121,"transformer_fault":0.0024,"busbar_fault":0.0008},"confidence":0.9847,"correct":true},"quorum":{"pred":"line_fault","display_pred":"SHORT CIRCUIT","probs":{"line_fault":0.4269,"breaker_fault":0.2366,"transformer_fault":0.2428,"busbar_fault":0.0936},"confidence":0.4269,"correct":true},"nexus":{"pred":"line_fault","display_pred":"SHORT CIRCUIT","probs":{"line_fault":0.663,"breaker_fault":0.2477,"transformer_fault":0.0757,"b